LGcode

This file lists the code in LGcode that comes from other open-source
projects. Each entry names the project, its copyright holder, its licence,
where the code lives in LGcode, and where the licence text is.

- T3 Code (https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code)
  Copyright (c) 2026 T3 Tools Inc. MIT License.
  In LGcode, one folder for each copied package, all under third_party/t3code/:
    third_party/t3code/effect-acp (the Agent Client Protocol client and server)
    third_party/t3code/node-sqlite (the SQLite client for Node.js)
    third_party/t3code/provider-instance (provider instance settings and home layouts)
    third_party/t3code/provider-testing (replay and fake-program test helpers)
    third_party/t3code/source-control (the commit-message credit remover)
  Each file, its source file in T3 Code and its changes are listed in
  third_party/t3code/README.md.
  Licence text: third_party/t3code/LICENSE.

- Inter (https://github.com/rsms/inter)
  Copyright 2016 The Inter Project Authors. SIL Open Font License 1.1.
  In LGcode: third_party/inter/InterVariable-latin.woff2, the Latin subset of
  Inter 4.001, used by the web mock in design/.
  Licence text: third_party/inter/OFL.txt.

- JetBrains Mono (https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono)
  Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors. SIL Open Font License 1.1.
  In LGcode: third_party/jetbrains-mono/JetBrainsMono-latin.woff2, the Latin
  subset of JetBrains Mono 2.211, used by the web mock in design/.
  Licence text: third_party/jetbrains-mono/OFL.txt.

- Lucide (https://lucide.dev)
  Copyright Lucide Contributors 2022, with portions copyright Cole Bemis
  2013-2022 as part of Feather (MIT). ISC License.
  In LGcode: icon paths inline in design/workbench.html and design/workbench.js.
  Each icon and where it is used are listed in third_party/lucide/README.md.
  Licence text: third_party/lucide/LICENSE.

LGcode is also inspired by Herdr Synapse
(https://github.com/vitalysim/herdr-synapse), Copyright 2026 Vitaly
